  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "The Potent records replace the plain ones through the Atromancy perk entries (`PerkSummon*Potent`). No spell was found for the `…NPC` copies (`SummonFrostAtronachNPC` 10EE48 and `SummonStormAtronachNPC` 10EE49), and none for their Potent perk entries.",
      "The summons use the placed atronachs as their template, mostly without `Stats`. `EncAtronachFlame` 023AA6 (level 5; on no census page, atronachs being out of the census): `SummonAtronachFlame` takes `Stats` from it; `SummonAtronachFlamePotent`, `SummonAtronachFlameThrall` and `…ThrallPotent` do not, and keep 10 · 30 · 35.",
      "`EncAtronachFrost` 023AA7 (level 16; on no census page): `SummonAtronachFrostNPC` takes `Stats` from it; `SummonAtronachFrost`, `…FrostPotent`, `…FrostNPCPotent`, `…FrostThrall` and `…FrostThrallPotent` do not, and keep 16 · 24 · 24 · 30 · 35.",
      "`EncAtronachStorm` 023AA8 (level 30; on no census page): `SummonAtronachStormNPC` takes `Stats` from it; `SummonAtronachStorm`, `…StormPotent`, `…StormNPCPotent` and `…StormThrallPotent` do not, and keep 30 · 35 · 35 · 35.",
      "`EncSummonFamiliar` uses `EncWolf` 023ABE (on *Wolf*) as its template but not for `Stats`, so it stays at level 2 when the wolf changes.",
      "Atronach-race records with no template, besides the three above: `EncAtronachFlameHoldPosLinked256` 0F8B11 (level 5), `DLC1_BF_FrostAtronachBossTemplate` 015138:Dawnguard.esm and `DLC1_BF_LVLFrostAtronachBoss` 00E193:Dawnguard.esm (level 16), `DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_FlameAtronach` 0008E4:cctwbsse001-puzzledungeon.esm (level 5) and `…FrostAtronach` 0008F8:cctwbsse001-puzzledungeon.esm (level 16); all on no census page. The untemplated wolves (`EncWolf`, `EncWolfIce`, `dunHunterWolfGuardian`) are on *Wolf*.",
      "Every row: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other record (`ccPEWSSE002_SummonEncDaedra`, the `dunFellglowLvlWarlockAtronachOrFamiliarCompanion` wrappers) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
